  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>想更方便地修復你的物品嗎？</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>快用我的模組吧！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/752/245/2023-11-02_07.png\" width=\"459\" height=\"326\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>所有物品都可以在「修復工作台」上修復。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/752/246/2023-11-02_07.png\" width=\"519\" height=\"386\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>要修復你的物品，你需要「修復石」物品！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/752/247/2023-11-02_07.png\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>1 個修復石 = 50 點耐久度堆疊</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>不再被鐵砧麻煩的修復系統所困擾！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
